### List permissions only
GET {{api}}/admin/rbac/items?type=PERMISSION
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get the CUSTOMER role and inherited permissions
GET {{api}}/admin/rbac/items/CUSTOMER
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List users
GET {{api}}/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20&q=rbac
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get one user and assigned roles
GET {{api}}/admin/users/{{customerUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Assign a role to a user (idempotent)
PUT {{api}}/admin/users/{{customerUserId}}/roles/ADMIN
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Revoke a role from a user (idempotent)
DELETE {{api}}/admin/users/{{customerUserId}}/roles/ADMIN
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Disable a customer
PATCH {{api}}/admin/users/{{customerUserId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DISABLED"
}

### Re-enable a customer
PATCH {{api}}/admin/users/{{customerUserId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Attempting to create a permission at runtime is rejected (expected 400 VALIDATION_FAILED)
POST {{api}}/admin/rbac/items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "address.audit",
  "type": "PERMISSION",
  "description": "Audit address changes"
}

### Create a custom role (first run returns 201)
POST {{api}}/admin/rbac/items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ADDRESS_AUDITOR",
  "type": "ROLE",
  "description": "Can view customer addresses"
}

### Add a built-in permission to the custom role (idempotent)
PUT {{api}}/admin/rbac/items/ADDRESS_AUDITOR/children/address.view
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Assign the custom role to the customer
PUT {{api}}/admin/users/{{customerUserId}}/roles/ADDRESS_AUDITOR
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Inspect the custom role
GET {{api}}/admin/rbac/items/ADDRESS_AUDITOR
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Remove the custom role from the customer
DELETE {{api}}/admin/users/{{customerUserId}}/roles/ADDRESS_AUDITOR
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Delete the custom role
DELETE {{api}}/admin/rbac/items/ADDRESS_AUDITOR
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Customer cannot access RBAC administration (expected 403)
GET {{api}}/admin/rbac/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Accept: application/json
